WEBVTT

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.000
"Proposal"
"Trickstar's"
"Revenge Match"

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:30.330
<i>We'll make it shine...</i>

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:34.540
<i>This "miracle"</i>

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:48.250
<i>It's what I think we'll call these days</i>

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:52.870
<i>We've run desperately</i>

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:57.040
<i>If it's somewhere that anyone can get to</i>

00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:02.200
<i>They wouldn't call us being here</i> a miracle, right?

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.500
<i>Revolution days.</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:05.290
<i>If you come to a stop</i>

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:06.160
<i>Break the limits.</i>

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:07.660
<i>You won't be able to go beyond</i>

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:08.750
<i>We can make new ways.</i>

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:10.120
<i>Now, let's start</i>

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:11.500
<i>Just face to face.</i>

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:15.790
<i>Toward that... unending sky</i>

00:01:15.790 --> 00:01:20.450
<i>Right now, what we're making resound</i>

00:01:20.450 --> 00:01:26.370
<i>(All through the days.)</i> Is an ensemble where we make each other better

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:31.040
<i>If we don't improve ourselves,</i> then we can't shine

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:40.790
<i>(We're beyond the sky.)</i> It's what we'll call the stars... a "miracle"

