00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:27.790
"Shuetsu Academy Bus Stop"

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:43.790
"Ibara Saegusa"

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:45.450
"'Adam' Reception Office"

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:32.450
"Nagisa Ran"

00:22:36.910 --> 00:22:44.620
<i>Mend a sweet sound with taut spun threads</i>

00:22:44.620 --> 00:22:48.500
<i>With infallible gears</i>

00:22:48.500 --> 00:22:53.540
<i>Pygmalion, who could create even life</i>

00:22:53.540 --> 00:23:00.040
<i>He was the unequaled incarnation of prosperity</i>

00:23:00.040 --> 00:23:03.910
<i>The thunder of nightmares struck suddenly</i>

00:23:03.910 --> 00:23:06.500
<i>Time crumbled away</i>

00:23:06.500 --> 00:23:15.370
<i>We now sing the story of the returning emperor</i>

00:23:15.370 --> 00:23:18.700
<i>It cannot be snatched away</i>

00:23:18.700 --> 00:23:21.120
<i>Your noble intent</i>

00:23:21.120 --> 00:23:22.540
<i>Raise it up</i>

00:23:22.540 --> 00:23:27.330
<i>Sing, sing the song of triumphant return</i>

00:23:45.620 --> 00:23:48.950
"Episode 20"
